 React app with a modern UI, built with Next.js and Tailwind CSS, featuring a comprehensive component library, multiple dashboard layouts, and server-side rendering capabilities.\\n\\n## What is Metronic Next.js?\\n\\nMetronic Next.js is a powerful React dashboard framework designed to help developers and businesses by:\\n\\n- Providing a complete set of UI components based on Radix UI primitives with Tailwind CSS styling\\n- Supporting multiple dashboard layouts and themes for different use cases\\n- Delivering excellent performance through Next.js App Router and server components\\n- Offering a scalable architecture for building complex admin interfaces and applications\\n- Providing enterprise-grade features like authentication, internationalization, and comprehensive error handling\\n\\n## Key Features\\n\\n- **Next.js 15.3**: Utilize the latest App Router architecture with server components and client components\\n- **React 19**: Build dynamic and reactive user interfaces with the latest React features\\n- **TypeScript**: Ensure type safety and improve developer experience\\n- **Tailwind CSS 4**: Rapidly design and customize responsive UIs with the latest version\\n- **Radix UI**: Leverage unstyled, accessible UI primitives for maximum flexibility\\n- **ReUI Components**: Benefit from our open-source React component library built on Radix UI\\n- **Multiple Layouts**: Choose from 10 pre-built dashboard layouts (Demo1-Demo10)\\n- **Authentication**: Implement secure user authentication with next-auth\\n- **App Router**: Modern, file-system based routing with nested layouts\\n- **Internationalization**: Support multiple languages with i18next\\n- **Custom Hooks**: Benefit from pre-built React hooks for common functionality\\n- **State Management**: Manage application state efficiently with React Context API\\n- **Provider System**: Leverage a flexible provider architecture for global features\\n- **Dark Mode**: Toggle between light and dark themes with next-themes\\n- **RTL Support**: Full support for right-to-left languages\\n- **Prisma ORM**: Type-safe database access and migrations\\n\\n## Why Choose Metronic Next.js?\\n\\n- **Modern Stack**: Built with the latest technologies for optimal developer experience\\n- **Performance**: Optimized for speed and efficiency with Next.js server components\\n- **Flexibility**: Adaptable for various admin and dashboard applications\\n- **Comprehensive**: All the components and tools you need for building complex interfaces\\n- **Maintainable**: Well-structured code and detailed documentation for long-term maintenance\\n- **Production-Ready**: Deploy with confidence using our simplified deployment guides\\n\\n## Getting Started\\n\\nGet your project up and running quickly with our [Installation Guide](/metronic-nextjs/getting-started/installation). Explore detailed documentation on components, features, and customization options to make the most of Metronic Next.js.\\n","code":"var Component=(()=>{var u=Object.create;var o=Object.defineProperty;var g=Object.getOwnPropertyDescriptor;var m=Object.getOwnPropertyNames;var p=Object.getPrototypeOf,x=Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty;var y=(i,e)=>()=>(e||i((e={exports:{}}).exports,e),e.exports),f=(i,e)=>{for(var t in e)o(i,t,{get:e[t],enumerable:!0})},a=(i,e,t,l)=>{if(e&&typeof e==\\"object\\"||typeof e==\\"function\\")for(let r of m(e))!x.call(i,r)&&r!==t&&o(i,r,{get:()=>e[r],enumerable:!(l=g(e,r))||l.enumerable});return i};var w=(i,e,t)=>(t=i!=null?u(p(i)):{},a(e||!i||!i.__esModule?o(t,\\"default\\",{value:i,enumerable:!0}):t,i)),v=i=>a(o({},\\"__esModule\\",{value:!0}),i);var c=y((L,s)=>{s.exports=_jsx_runtime});var b={};f(b,{default:()=>h,frontmatter:()=>k});var n=w(c()),k={title:\\"Introduction\\",description:\\"A guide to understanding and utilizing the Metronic Next.js Boilerplate.\\"};function d(i){let e={a:\\"a\\",h2:\\"h2\\",li:\\"li\\",line:\\"line\\",p:\\"p\\",strong:\\"strong\\",svg:\\"svg\\",ul:\\"ul\\",...i.components};return(0,n