erformance and SEO optimization.\\n- Providing scalability through server-rendered, client-side, or hybrid applications.\\n- Offering a foundation for diverse applications, including CRMs, ERPs, and beyond, making it an excellent starting point for modern web apps.\\n\\n## Key Features\\n\\n- **Next.js Integration**: Combine server-side rendering, static site generation, and client-side rendering for optimal performance.\\n- **React**: Develop interactive, reusable, and component-driven user interfaces.\\n- **Tailwind CSS**: Quickly design sleek, responsive UIs.\\n- **TanStack Query & Table**: Efficiently handle server-side state management and advanced data tables.\\n- **Prisma OR:** Simplify database management with intuitive modeling and querying.\\n- **Zod**: Ensure runtime validation with a powerful TypeScript schema tool.\\n- **React Hook Form**: Simplify form management and validation.\\n- **Radix UI**: Use unstyled UI primitives for maximum design flexibility.\\n- **Dark Mode Support**: Deliver an enhanced experience with easy theme toggling.\\n- **RTL (Right-to-Left) Support**: Full accessibility for right-to-left languages.\\n- **i18n (Internationalization)**: Easily implement multilingual capabilities for global reach.\\n\\n## Why Choose Shoplit?\\n\\n- **Efficiency**: Streamlined workflows and developer tools accelerate your project timeline.\\n- **Flexibility**: Perfectly adaptable for businesses of any size and across industries.\\n- **Performance**: Engineered to meet modern web application standards with exceptional speed and reliability.\\n- **Community and Support**: Backed by an active developer community and detailed documentation to guide you every step of the way.\\n\\n## Getting Started\\n\\nJumpstart your project in minutes with our [Quick Start Guide](/shoplit/installation). Explore detailed tutorials, feature overviews, and API references to unlock the full potential of Shoplit.","code":"var Component=(()=>{var g=Object.create;var l=Object.