cations\\n- Providing enterprise-grade features like Supabase authentication, internationalization, and comprehensive error handling\\n\\n## Key Features\\n\\n- **React 19**: Build dynamic and reactive user interfaces with the latest React features\\n- **TypeScript**: Ensure type safety and improve developer experience\\n- **Vite**: Enjoy lightning-fast HMR and optimized builds\\n- **Tailwind CSS**: Rapidly design and customize responsive UIs\\n- **Radix UI**: Leverage unstyled, accessible UI primitives for maximum flexibility\\n- **Component Library**: Access a comprehensive UI component library with consistent design patterns\\n- **Multiple Layouts**: Choose from several pre-built dashboard layouts\\n- **Supabase Authentication**: Implement secure user authentication with social login support\\n- **Routing**: Organized route structure with React Router v7\\n- **Internationalization**: Support multiple languages with react-intl\\n- **Custom Hooks**: Benefit from pre-built React hooks for common functionality\\n- **State Management**: Manage application state efficiently with Context API\\n- **Provider System**: Leverage a flexible provider architecture for global features\\n- **Dark Mode**: Toggle between light and dark themes\\n- **RTL Support**: Full support for right-to-left languages\\n\\n## Why Choose Metronic React?\\n\\n- **Modern Stack**: Built with the latest technologies for optimal developer experience\\n- **Performance**: Optimized for speed and efficiency with Vite\'s build system\\n- **Flexibility**: Adaptable for various admin and dashboard applications\\n- **Comprehensive**: All the components and tools you need for building complex interfaces\\n- **Maintainable**: Well-structured code and detailed documentation for long-term maintenance\\n- **Production-Ready**: Deploy with confidence using our simplified deployment guides\\n\\n## Getting Started\\n\\nGet your project up and running quickly with our [Installation Guide](/metronic-react/getting-star