y application structure with Next.js 15 and React 19\\n- Offering robust user authentication and management through Supabase integration\\n- Supporting easy customization with flexible design and functionality integration\\n- Delivering top-tier performance and SEO optimization\\n- Providing scalability through server-rendered, client-side, or hybrid applications\\n- Offering a foundation for diverse applications, including dashboards, admin panels, and beyond, making it an excellent starting point for modern web apps\\n\\n## Key Features\\n\\n- **Next.js 15**: Combine server-side rendering, static site generation, and client-side rendering for optimal performance with the latest Next.js features\\n- **React 19**: Develop interactive, reusable, and component-driven user interfaces with the latest React features\\n- **Tailwind CSS 4**: Quickly design sleek, responsive UIs with the latest version of Tailwind\\n- **TanStack Query & Table**: Efficiently handle server-side state management and advanced data tables\\n- **Supabase**: Complete backend solution with authentication, database, and storage capabilities\\n- **Radix UI**: Use extensive collection of unstyled UI primitives for maximum design flexibility\\n- **Form Management**: Streamlined form handling with React Hook Form and Zod validation\\n- **Dark Mode Support**: Deliver an enhanced experience with easy theme toggling using next-themes\\n- **RTL (Right-to-Left) Support**: Full accessibility for right-to-left languages\\n- **i18n (Internationalization)**: Easily implement multilingual capabilities for global reach\\n\\n## Why Choose Supastart?\\n\\n- **Efficiency**: Streamlined workflows and developer tools accelerate your project timeline\\n- **Flexibility**: Perfectly adaptable for businesses of any size and across industries\\n- **Performance**: Engineered to meet modern web application standards with exceptional speed and reliability\\n- **Community and Support**: Backed by an active developer community a