- **Real Estate-Preview**: Added new app concept - [Preview](https://keenthemes.com/metronic/concepts/nextjs/real-estate)\\n  - Real Estate Layout\\n  - Properties List\\n  - Map View\\n  - Property Details\\n  - Filtering & Sorting\\n\\n**Next.js Version:**\\n\\n- Updated to latest Next.js version\\n\\n## v9.4.0 - 19 December, 2025.\\n\\n**Features:**\\n\\n- **Todo App-Preview**: Added new app concept - [Preview](https://keenthemes.com/metronic/concepts/nextjs/todo)\\n  - Todo App Layout\\n  - Todo List\\n  - Tasks Management\\n  - Today Tasks\\n  - Upcoming Tasks\\n  - AI Assistant\\n\\n**Next.js Version:**\\n\\n- Updated to latest Next.js version\\n\\n## v9.3.9 - 12 December, 2025.\\n\\n**Security Update:**\\n\\n- Added: Next.js 16.0.10 security update - [Preview](https://nextjs.org/blog/security-update-2025-12-11)\\n- Added: React 19.2.3 security update\\n- Added: React DOM 19.2.3 security update\\n\\n## v9.3.8 - 10 December, 2025.\\n\\n**Features:**\\n\\n- **Todo App**: Added new app concept - [Preview](https://keenthemes.com/metronic/concepts/nextjs/todo)\\n  - Todo App Layout\\n  - Todo List\\n  - Tasks Management\\n  - Today Tasks\\n  - Upcoming Tasks\\n  - AI Assistant\\n\\n**Security Update:**\\n\\n- Added: Next.js 16.0.8 security update - [Preview](https://nextjs.org/blog/CVE-2025-66478)\\n- Added: React 19.2.1 security update\\n- Added: React DOM 19.2.1 security update\\n\\n## v9.3.7 - 5 December, 2025.\\n\\n**Starter Kits:**\\n\\n- **Layout 39 Starter Kit**: Added new demo layout - [Preview](https://keenthemes.com/metronic/starter-kits/nextjs/layout-39)\\n  - Todo App Layout\\n  - Sidebar Panel\\n  - Tags List\\n  - Status Panel\\n  - User Menu\\n  - AI Sidebar\\n\\n## v9.3.6 - 21 November, 2025.\\n\\n**Features:**\\n\\n* Added: **AI Chat** - [Preview](https://keenthemes.com/metronic/concepts/nextjs/ai)\\n  * Prompt Starter\\n  * Prompt Messages\\n  * Thread Settings\\n  * Prompt Toolbar\\n  * Chats History\\n  * Pinned Chats\\n\\n## v9.3.5 - 14 November, 2025.\\n\\n**Starter Kits:**\\n\\n- **Layout 38 Starter Kit**: Added new demo layout - [Preview](https://keenthemes.com/metronic/starter-kits/nextjs/layout-38)\\n  - AI Chatbot Layout\\n  - Sidebar Panel\\n  - AI Model Selection\\n  - Recent Chats\\n  - Share Chats\\n  - Pinned Chats\\n\\n## v9.3.4 - 5 November, 2025.\\n\\n**Features:**\\n\\n- **Calendar App Concept**: Added new app concept - [Preview](https://keenthemes.com/metronic/concepts/nextjs/calendar)\\n  - Calendar Month View\\n  - Calendar Week View\\n  - Calendar Day View\\n  - Calendar Agenda View\\n  - Add Event Dialog\\n  - Edit Event Dialog\\n  - Drag & Drop Events\\n\\n**Starter Kits:**\\n\\n- **Layout 37 Starter Kit**: Added new demo layout - [Preview](https://keenthemes.com/metronic/starter-kits/nextjs/layout-37)\\n\\n## v9.3.3 - 29 October, 2025.\\n\\n**Features:**\\n\\n- **Mail App Concept**: Added new features - [Preview](https://keenthemes.com/metronic/concepts/nextjs/mail-app)\\n  - Reply Message\\n  - Forward Message\\n  - Message Toolbar\\n  - Add Labels\\n  - Ask AI Dialog\\n\\n**Starter Kits:**\\n\\n- **Layout 36 Starter Kit**: Added new demo layout - [Preview](https://keenthemes.com/metronic/starter-kits/nextjs/layout-36)\\n\\n## v9.3.2 - 17 October, 2025.\\n\\n**Features:**\\n\\n- **Mail App Concept**: Added new features - [Preview](https://keenthemes.com/metronic/concepts/nextjs/mail)\\n  - Message Compose\\n  - Direct Messages\\n  - Add Teammates\\n\\n**Starter Kits:**\\n\\n- **Layout 35 Starter Kit**: Added new demo layout - [Preview](https://keenthemes.com/metronic/starter-kits/nextjs/layout-35)\\n\\n## v9.3.1 - 10 October, 2025.\\n\\n**Features:**\\n\\n- **Mail App Concept**: Added new app concept - [Preview](https://keenthemes.com/metronic/concepts/nextjs/mail)\\n  - Messages List\\n  - Message View\\n  - Empty State\\n\\n**Starter Kits:**\\n\\n- **Layout 33 Starter Kit**: Added new demo layout - [Preview](https://keenthemes.com/metronic/starter-kits/nextjs/layout-33)\\n- **Layo